        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Panther, German tank destroyer\n- Places: Eastern Front, Western Front\n- Organizations: Nazi Germany\n\nFacts:\n- From mid-1943, the Panther medium tank was deployed on the Eastern Front and the Western Front.\n- The Panther medium tank was sometimes called the \"Mark V\".\n- During World War II, Nazi Germany built a tank destroyer that used the Panther's armor and suspension for its chassis.",
